===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug}} Any [[substance]] that can [[destroy]] or [[inhibit]] the [[growth]] of [[bacteria]] and similar [[microorganism]]s, generally transported by the lymphatic system.
